WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.625 --> 01:38.705
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:39.505 --> 01:41.625
10 MONTHS LATER

01:47.065 --> 01:48.265
Shang Zhitao.

01:48.345 --> 01:50.105
You haven't contacted me
for almost a week.

01:50.665 --> 01:52.865
I told you

01:52.945 --> 01:55.585
that I was conducting a study
in the Gobi Desert with the project team.

01:55.665 --> 01:57.545
The signal over there was bad.

01:57.625 --> 01:59.305
Aren't you going to the US
to report your work?

01:59.385 --> 02:00.905
You haven't left yet?

02:00.985 --> 02:02.225
You're so heartless.

02:03.025 --> 02:05.225
Do you think I can leave
without making sure you're fine?

02:08.905 --> 02:10.905
It's still a long-distance relationship.
Where I'm at makes no difference.

02:10.985 --> 02:12.705
The US and Beijing are the same.

02:15.705 --> 02:16.585
Luan Nian.

02:17.985 --> 02:20.265
I wish you success in your report.

02:22.665 --> 02:23.905
When I'm back home,

02:23.985 --> 02:25.025
let's have a video call.

02:25.105 --> 02:26.025
I want to see Luke.

02:27.505 --> 02:28.385
Say it again.

02:28.465 --> 02:30.225
You just want to see Luke?

02:30.865 --> 02:31.985
Of course.

02:32.065 --> 02:33.665
That's my dog.

02:34.265 --> 02:35.545
Say it again.

02:35.625 --> 02:36.625
Whose dog?

02:37.305 --> 02:38.305
Our dog.

02:44.905 --> 02:46.585
Let's leave it here. I'll arrive soon.

02:57.025 --> 02:59.345
I WILL WATCH OVER YOU FROM BEYOND
THIS WORLD, UNTIL YOUR LIFE IS WHOLE

03:10.265 --> 03:11.745
-Thank you.
-Okay.

03:11.825 --> 03:12.785
Tao.

03:15.505 --> 03:16.745
Why are you here?

03:19.105 --> 03:21.185
My assignment in Northwestern China
is ending.

03:22.425 --> 03:24.425
I wanted to see you before I leave.

03:25.185 --> 03:26.945
Why didn't you send me a text?

03:27.025 --> 03:29.065
What if you didn't see me?
I just came back from a business trip.

03:30.025 --> 03:32.345
Come up. Let's have a drink.

03:32.425 --> 03:34.905
It's fine. It's quite late.

03:34.985 --> 03:36.225
I have to hurry and catch the last bus.

03:38.705 --> 03:39.625
This is for you.

03:40.265 --> 03:41.465
I got it from the mountains.

03:42.065 --> 03:43.025
I think you might like it.

03:48.145 --> 03:49.905
There was a year

03:49.985 --> 03:53.705
when I received flowers
every day for a week at work.

03:53.785 --> 03:55.145
Was that you?

03:58.385 --> 04:01.065
Back then, you said
you wanted flowers so much,

04:01.145 --> 04:02.545
but if it was prepared beforehand,

04:02.625 --> 04:04.185
it wouldn't be surprising.

04:04.265 --> 04:06.585
So, I sent them for a few days as a prank.

04:08.705 --> 04:10.505
I hope you liked them back then.

04:11.545 --> 04:12.505
Thanks, Zhu.

04:12.585 --> 04:13.945
I liked them a lot.

04:14.025 --> 04:15.745
Oh, my work here is done

04:15.825 --> 04:16.665
after a month.

04:16.745 --> 04:17.745
When I return to Beijing,

04:17.825 --> 04:18.865
let's go watch a movie, okay?

04:18.944 --> 04:19.785
Midnight screening.

04:19.865 --> 04:20.905
We'll go every weekend.

04:20.985 --> 04:23.025
Let's watch all the old movies together.

04:23.105 --> 04:24.345
We'll call Sun Yu too.

04:25.465 --> 04:26.305
Sure.

04:26.945 --> 04:28.105
I'll buy the tickets.

04:28.705 --> 04:30.185
No. Let Sun Yu buy them.

04:30.865 --> 04:32.665
Her team is doing very well now.

04:32.745 --> 04:34.185
You haven't seen each other for so long.

04:34.265 --> 04:37.065
If Sun Yu knows that you're going back,
she will be so happy.

04:37.145 --> 04:38.985
-Let me tell Sun Yu.
-Don't.

04:40.505 --> 04:41.945
Don't disturb her.

04:45.465 --> 04:46.665
Before you

04:47.265 --> 04:50.065
return to Beijing, do you need
to go back to your hometown?

04:50.145 --> 04:51.505
How's your mother?

04:51.585 --> 04:52.705
Is she doing well?

04:59.505 --> 05:00.345
She passed away.

05:06.105 --> 05:08.065
When did that happen?

05:11.585 --> 05:13.105
During the Chinese New Year.

05:15.225 --> 05:16.065
You…

05:17.265 --> 05:18.665
Why didn't you tell us?

05:21.785 --> 05:24.705
That was the time when all of you
were reunited with your family members.

05:28.785 --> 05:30.305
I didn't want all of you to be sad.

05:41.345 --> 05:42.185
What about your younger sister?

05:43.705 --> 05:44.585
Is she well?

05:45.865 --> 05:47.385
She is studying well.

05:50.145 --> 05:51.025
What about your father?

05:53.065 --> 05:53.945
He's doing well too.

05:57.305 --> 05:58.185
What about you?

05:59.745 --> 06:01.105
Are you well, Sun Yuanzhu?

06:06.465 --> 06:07.505
I'm well.

06:13.345 --> 06:14.385
That's good enough.

06:19.665 --> 06:20.825
Let me take you to the bus stop.

06:20.905 --> 06:21.985
I'll drop off my luggage.

06:22.065 --> 06:22.905
Wait for me.

06:25.265 --> 06:26.345
Tao.

06:37.585 --> 06:39.105
Actually, I'm unwell.

06:43.385 --> 06:44.625
I'm very sad.

06:46.345 --> 06:48.705
I've put in a lot of effort.
I tried to change.

06:50.265 --> 06:52.465
But no matter what I do,

06:53.385 --> 06:54.705
and how much effort I put into it,

06:56.985 --> 06:59.625
I couldn't achieve the result I wanted.

07:11.865 --> 07:15.465
I've put in 99% effort into it.

07:16.985 --> 07:18.545
Why can't I…

07:21.105 --> 07:24.065
get that final 1%

07:24.145 --> 07:26.025
luck?

07:30.665 --> 07:31.905
Don't cry.

07:39.025 --> 07:40.065
It's fine.

07:58.705 --> 08:00.425
Don't cry, all right?

08:02.425 --> 08:04.665
You will get that 1%.

09:19.065 --> 09:20.065
Sun Yu.

09:22.305 --> 09:24.345
Sun Yuanzhu's mother passed away.

09:29.385 --> 09:31.545
He is quite sad. Do you want to visit him?

09:35.025 --> 09:36.265
I'll come tomorrow.

09:38.145 --> 09:39.465
Let me send you the address.

09:39.545 --> 09:40.465
No need.

09:41.545 --> 09:42.985
I've been there many times.

09:44.265 --> 09:46.585
Throughout my whole life,

09:46.665 --> 09:49.785
I've only traveled a long way,
regardless of any obstacles,

09:50.705 --> 09:51.905
again and again for his sake.

09:55.385 --> 09:58.105
Just to have a meal with him

09:59.905 --> 10:00.825
and have a quick chat.

10:02.025 --> 10:03.025
Then,

10:03.825 --> 10:06.385
I'd take the early flight back
the next day.

10:07.585 --> 10:08.625
I'll be there tomorrow.

10:10.585 --> 10:11.425
Okay.

10:20.625 --> 10:25.545
BEIJING TO LANZHOU
FLIGHT TICKET PURCHASE WEBSITE

10:25.625 --> 10:28.465
SELECT PASSENGER: SUN YU

10:28.545 --> 10:30.345
TOTAL: RMB 734, PAY NOW

10:34.225 --> 10:35.545
PAYMENT SUCCESSFUL

11:00.945 --> 11:02.985
SHANG ZHITAO

11:12.745 --> 11:15.745
The number you are calling is busy.

11:31.025 --> 11:33.185
SHANG ZHITAO

11:38.585 --> 11:39.745
Hello?

11:40.745 --> 11:41.585
Luan Nian.

11:42.665 --> 11:43.745
Are you busy?

11:43.825 --> 11:44.665
Right.

11:45.465 --> 11:46.305
I was busy.

11:46.905 --> 11:48.625
Then, I'll video call you tomorrow.

11:49.305 --> 11:50.145
All right?

11:51.465 --> 11:52.705
I'm going to the US
the day after tomorrow.

11:53.425 --> 11:54.905
I'll leave Luke at the pet shop.

11:54.985 --> 11:56.585
I'm returning to Beijing next week.

11:57.305 --> 11:58.145
Okay.

11:59.985 --> 12:00.825
I'm hanging up.

12:36.705 --> 12:39.465
GROUP CHAT: WAS TRACY TALKING ABOUT YOU
AT THE MEETING?

12:39.545 --> 12:41.545
Is she going to be our future lady boss?

12:46.865 --> 12:49.745
In the future, we must be cautious
when we speak in front of Yilia and Luke.

12:50.825 --> 12:52.265
I also heard from our US colleagues

12:52.345 --> 12:54.025
that they go on
this business trip together.

12:54.105 --> 12:55.545
They also have meals together often.

12:57.225 --> 12:59.665
Yilia is a woman born in a rich family.

12:59.745 --> 13:01.105
She's a good match for Luke.

13:02.425 --> 13:05.345
I heard Yilia is the daughter of Mr. You,
our biggest client.

13:05.425 --> 13:07.145
Her father likes Luke a lot.

13:07.225 --> 13:09.345
He's going to allocate
next year's advertising budget to Lime.

13:21.865 --> 13:22.825
Tao.

13:22.905 --> 13:24.465
Lumi misses you so much.

13:27.865 --> 13:29.345
Shang Zhitao!

13:30.985 --> 13:32.385
You're finally back!

13:32.465 --> 13:34.185
I miss you so much.

13:34.265 --> 13:35.385
Are you staying for good this time?

13:36.065 --> 13:38.745
Next month. I'm coming back
for good next month.

13:39.785 --> 13:43.145
Do you know what kind of life

13:43.225 --> 13:44.145
I was living in Lime

13:44.225 --> 13:45.905
while you were assigned to work abroad?

13:47.105 --> 13:50.465
I've not met another coworker like you

13:50.545 --> 13:52.785
who is impressive,

13:52.865 --> 13:56.305
intelligent, and amazing after you left.

13:57.025 --> 13:58.305
Stop praising me.

13:58.385 --> 14:00.745
Without you, who's going to pamper me?

14:01.745 --> 14:02.825
Let me tell you.

14:02.905 --> 14:05.505
You'll soon be promoted
to specialist in Lime.

14:05.585 --> 14:07.465
You might be the one
pampering me in the future.

14:08.425 --> 14:10.545
I'm still preparing my work report.

14:10.625 --> 14:13.065
Let's wait
until the assessment result is out.

14:13.145 --> 14:15.585
I've gone through everything for you.

14:16.865 --> 14:18.105
The judges of the first round

14:18.185 --> 14:19.825
are the bosses of each division

14:19.905 --> 14:21.665
and two former specialists.

14:22.265 --> 14:23.945
Will is mine.

14:24.025 --> 14:26.785
If he dares give you a low score,
I'll not forgive him.

14:26.865 --> 14:29.665
Tracy has been treating you well, right?

14:29.745 --> 14:31.785
I don't have to say
anything more about Luke.

14:31.865 --> 14:33.345
He's fair, just, and open.

14:33.425 --> 14:36.385
So, your promotion to a specialist

14:36.465 --> 14:38.505
is set in stone.

14:40.345 --> 14:41.185
Is Will

14:42.265 --> 14:43.265
yours?

14:46.505 --> 14:48.185
Well, soon.

14:48.945 --> 14:51.505
Soon? I thought he was already yours.

14:51.585 --> 14:53.705
You're so bad. Are you teasing me?

14:53.785 --> 14:55.825
Of course not. I'll buy you coffee later.

14:55.905 --> 14:57.265
That's more like it.

14:58.385 --> 14:59.745
Luke is back. Do you know that?

15:01.745 --> 15:04.585
Isn't Luke staying in the US for a month?

15:05.545 --> 15:06.985
He came back early.

15:07.065 --> 15:08.425
Go and report to him

15:08.505 --> 15:09.945
when he is here later.

15:13.105 --> 15:14.945
Specialist.

15:22.825 --> 15:23.665
Luke.

15:34.905 --> 15:36.185
Come in.

15:40.945 --> 15:41.785
You're back.

15:44.385 --> 15:46.665
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

15:47.865 --> 15:49.065
I made a last-minute change to my plans.

15:54.985 --> 15:55.865
What is it?

15:58.025 --> 15:58.865
No…

15:59.545 --> 16:02.065
It's nothing.
I just came to report to you.

16:06.985 --> 16:07.825
Sure.

17:00.745 --> 17:01.705
Why are you still here?

17:03.665 --> 17:04.785
I'm waiting for you.

17:21.665 --> 17:22.585
What's wrong?

17:22.665 --> 17:24.385
Something bad happened
when you were in the US?

17:27.065 --> 17:28.025
Everything was normal.

17:29.985 --> 17:31.345
We've not seen each other for two months.

17:31.425 --> 17:32.585
Don't you miss me?

17:32.665 --> 17:33.665
I missed you a lot.

17:35.305 --> 17:36.145
Is that so?

17:38.225 --> 17:39.105
I didn't.

17:43.505 --> 17:44.345
What's wrong?

17:45.785 --> 17:46.945
Did I offend you somehow?

17:47.025 --> 17:47.985
You're scaring me.

17:49.985 --> 17:51.265
Me? Scaring you? No way.

17:52.545 --> 17:54.465
You insisted on staying
in Northwestern China.

17:54.545 --> 17:55.465
You said you liked it there.

17:55.545 --> 17:57.105
What's the point of missing you?

17:57.665 --> 17:58.945
I can't transfer you back either.

17:59.945 --> 18:01.985
You have your own definition of success

18:02.065 --> 18:03.745
and your own way of living.
I respect that.

18:03.825 --> 18:05.105
I have no right to interfere.

18:05.185 --> 18:06.745
You have the right
to choose your own life.

18:06.825 --> 18:07.705
No problem.

18:10.425 --> 18:12.465
Can we talk nicely?

18:12.545 --> 18:13.785
What are you trying to say here?

18:14.705 --> 18:15.545
What am I trying to say?

18:16.665 --> 18:18.785
My girlfriend was talking

18:18.865 --> 18:20.505
with another man downstairs

18:20.585 --> 18:21.625
while crying and hugging him
the whole night.

18:26.505 --> 18:27.585
What do you mean?

18:28.105 --> 18:29.665
What do you mean by

18:30.505 --> 18:31.865
hugging and crying with someone else?

18:34.305 --> 18:35.825
Shang Zhitao, you're quite something.

18:36.745 --> 18:38.305
You keep saying you miss me,

18:38.385 --> 18:40.025
but you keep looking for your next one.

18:40.105 --> 18:42.945
Do you think you are so charming
that you can start fooling around

18:43.025 --> 18:44.425
-with different men?
-Luan Nian.

18:45.785 --> 18:47.225
You can choose not to trust me,

18:47.305 --> 18:48.985
but you cannot accuse me
of something I never did.

19:00.145 --> 19:01.145
Did I confront you about this?

19:01.825 --> 19:03.345
Did I confront you
when you dined with another woman?

19:03.425 --> 19:04.625
I didn't, right?

19:04.705 --> 19:05.625
Did I confront you

19:05.705 --> 19:07.225
about why the company
is full of rumors about you two?

19:07.305 --> 19:09.745
I didn't, right? Because I trust you.

19:09.825 --> 19:12.345
I've always thought that
we knew each other well

19:12.425 --> 19:14.145
in terms of our social circle.

19:14.225 --> 19:16.265
However, you are pinning
such a big accusation on me

19:16.345 --> 19:18.065
because I went to comfort my friend.

19:18.145 --> 19:19.505
Should we just avoid any interactions

19:19.585 --> 19:21.585
with the other gender
because we are together?

19:21.665 --> 19:24.345
No need. I didn't avoid it.

19:25.705 --> 19:27.745
I can also get along well

19:27.825 --> 19:30.345
with women whom I admire
and work well with me.

19:30.425 --> 19:31.265
Even if I get off work,

19:31.345 --> 19:32.625
I don't think
having a meal or having a chat

19:32.705 --> 19:34.265
is a waste of time.

19:34.345 --> 19:35.225
I know.

19:35.305 --> 19:37.425
I know you can admire

19:37.505 --> 19:39.265
someone you admire openly.

19:39.345 --> 19:41.545
I've never felt jealous about it.
It's true.

19:42.585 --> 19:44.705
So, Luan Nian, please view

19:44.785 --> 19:47.705
my relationship
with Sun Yuanzhu rationally.

19:47.785 --> 19:49.665
After all, during a few difficult moments
in my life,

19:49.745 --> 19:51.065
it was him,

19:51.145 --> 19:52.385
Lumi, and Sun Yu who kept me company.

19:54.425 --> 19:57.025
Luan Nian, I want you to know
that no matter how much I love you,

19:57.105 --> 19:59.185
I'd never give up my friends.

20:00.025 --> 20:02.065
I also won't interfere with you
working with Song Ying.

20:08.465 --> 20:10.425
That's a fair exchange.

20:11.105 --> 20:12.505
I hope you remember and stick to it.

22:13.225 --> 22:14.945
Were you at Northwestern China that day?

22:18.985 --> 22:21.065
How come you knew Sun Yuanzhu cried?

22:26.865 --> 22:30.265
I would like to know
why you came that day.

22:30.945 --> 22:32.345
I would like to know why you cried.

22:39.265 --> 22:41.185
Sun Yuanzhu's family member passed away.

22:42.025 --> 22:43.345
He was sad.

22:45.025 --> 22:46.305
He seemed off emotionally.

22:46.865 --> 22:49.145
I figured he was ill. He couldn't eat.

22:50.465 --> 22:52.505
I cried because I felt bad.

22:56.265 --> 23:00.065
Luan Nian. He is
a really good friend of mine.

23:00.145 --> 23:02.785
Can you not get the wrong idea about him
and about our friendship?

23:09.105 --> 23:09.985
I'll try my best.

23:13.505 --> 23:14.905
So, you were there that day.

23:15.945 --> 23:16.985
Why?

23:21.945 --> 23:23.505
Because I suddenly missed you.

23:44.705 --> 23:47.145
TIANTONG YUAN STATION TIMETABLE

23:54.865 --> 23:56.185
REDEFINING THE ROLE OF THE ACCOUNT MANAGER
FROM EXECUTION TO SOLUTIONS

23:56.265 --> 23:58.185
2016-2017: METHODOLOGY CONSOLIDATION
AND STRATEGIC ELEVATION

24:01.985 --> 24:03.305
WORK PERFORMANCE REPORT

24:12.025 --> 24:13.425
1. BRING PARENTS TO TRAVEL
2. LEARN ENGLISH 3. LEARN HOW TO DRIVE

24:13.505 --> 24:14.625
4. LEARN FRENCH 5. GO TO TIBET
6. TRAVEL ABROAD

24:14.705 --> 24:16.105
7. READ 200 BOOKS
8. MAKE THREE FRIENDS AND ABOVE

24:16.185 --> 24:17.585
9. MARRY THE PERSON I LOVE
10. BECOME A LIME SPECIALIST

24:22.185 --> 24:23.025
Flora.

24:23.105 --> 24:25.505
If you are ready, let's begin.

24:29.905 --> 24:32.025
I joined Lime in 2012.

24:33.065 --> 24:34.385
My first lesson about work

24:34.465 --> 24:36.425
was from my interview with my boss.

24:37.305 --> 24:39.305
I had to shed my student's mindset,

24:39.385 --> 24:42.185
get my superior's attention,
and manage upward.

24:43.225 --> 24:45.785
Time is precious for everyone at work,

24:46.585 --> 24:47.745
including mine.

24:47.825 --> 24:48.905
Are you done?

24:49.545 --> 24:51.065
I thought your time was worthless,

24:51.145 --> 24:52.505
so I can put off your task.

24:56.025 --> 24:57.145
I understand.

24:57.225 --> 24:59.825
In the future,
I'll make my request directly.

24:59.905 --> 25:01.185
Thank you for your guidance.

25:01.265 --> 25:04.465
My first project at Lime
was an e-commerce advertisement.

25:04.545 --> 25:06.385
This project taught me

25:06.465 --> 25:08.545
to be clear about the scope
of my responsibilities.

25:09.265 --> 25:11.545
Due to a messy report given to the client,

25:11.625 --> 25:13.585
I was scolded by my superior
and felt aggrieved.

25:13.665 --> 25:14.985
Now, I get it.

25:15.065 --> 25:16.905
Being a professional
is not about completing the task,

25:17.705 --> 25:18.705
but completing it correctly.

25:21.545 --> 25:23.665
In my third year in Lime,

25:23.745 --> 25:25.985
I started digging deeply
into industry data

25:26.585 --> 25:29.305
and analyzing
the company's past case reports.

25:29.385 --> 25:31.345
I stepped into our clients' shoes
to think about what they need,

25:31.425 --> 25:33.585
what they care about,
what I can provide to them,

25:33.665 --> 25:34.825
and my individual strength.

25:36.385 --> 25:38.585
Until I completed an S-class project

25:38.665 --> 25:39.905
on my own,

25:41.425 --> 25:43.465
I finally understood

25:43.545 --> 25:47.105
the meaning of being an account manager.

25:55.465 --> 25:56.985
Until now,

25:57.065 --> 25:59.185
I still remember the time I first met you.

26:00.465 --> 26:01.745
It has been six years now.

26:01.825 --> 26:03.585
Time passes so quickly.

26:03.665 --> 26:06.625
Before the other two judges
ask you questions,

26:06.705 --> 26:08.305
I'd like to thank you

26:08.385 --> 26:10.065
for your contribution
over the last six years

26:10.145 --> 26:11.745
on behalf of the company.

26:12.585 --> 26:14.065
Thank you, Flora.

26:40.105 --> 26:41.065
How was it?

26:44.185 --> 26:45.425
I did my best.

26:46.305 --> 26:47.505
When will the result be out?

26:48.185 --> 26:49.625
Probably during the annual meeting.

26:50.585 --> 26:52.745
Then, let me congratulate you

26:52.825 --> 26:55.425
on becoming a Lime Specialist in advance.

26:57.185 --> 26:59.305
Let's pick up Yuanzhu later,
and we'll go grocery shopping.

26:59.385 --> 27:01.025
I must tell Zhu

27:01.105 --> 27:02.665
that I completed the work report

27:02.745 --> 27:04.785
using the method he taught me.

27:04.865 --> 27:07.585
I must thank him well.

27:09.665 --> 27:11.625
His residential study ends today.

27:12.625 --> 27:14.785
I previously coaxed him

27:14.865 --> 27:16.825
into doing a check-up
with me at the hospital.

27:17.465 --> 27:18.825
He does have depression.

27:20.145 --> 27:22.105
However, he is willing to accept treatment

27:22.185 --> 27:24.265
and take medications.

27:24.345 --> 27:26.145
The treatment is quite effective.

27:27.465 --> 27:28.785
He has been eating well,

27:28.865 --> 27:29.825
and he started smiling.

27:29.905 --> 27:31.225
He loves to talk too.

27:31.825 --> 27:33.545
A few days ago,
I took him to watch a movie at night.

27:33.625 --> 27:35.425
He was having fun.

27:35.505 --> 27:37.985
He was so happy
that I didn't know what to say.

27:38.865 --> 27:40.065
When I saw him smiling,

27:40.985 --> 27:42.305
I felt happy too.

27:44.905 --> 27:46.025
Me too.

27:47.105 --> 27:48.825
When I see both of you happy,

27:49.745 --> 27:51.025
I feel happy too.

27:53.025 --> 27:54.505
Our lives

27:55.265 --> 27:57.345
will surely get better.

27:58.905 --> 27:59.905
Yes.

28:05.505 --> 28:06.345
Look.

28:07.865 --> 28:08.905
It's so pretty.

28:10.545 --> 28:11.385
Hurry.

28:11.465 --> 28:12.785
Take a picture with your phone.

28:12.865 --> 28:14.465
Send it to Yuanzhu.

28:14.545 --> 28:15.785
Tell him to wait for us.

28:41.785 --> 28:43.785
Why isn't he picking up?

28:43.865 --> 28:44.945
He's not picking up?

28:45.025 --> 28:46.105
-Let me call him.
-He didn't reply to my text either.

28:46.185 --> 28:47.065
Call him.

28:47.145 --> 28:48.945
THE CROWNING MASTERPIECE
ON CHANG'AN AVENUE

28:49.025 --> 28:50.025
Are you calling him?

28:50.105 --> 28:50.985
Yes. He's not answering.

28:51.065 --> 28:52.345
He didn't answer?

28:53.025 --> 28:54.705
Is he working overtime without telling me?

28:54.785 --> 28:57.025
I don't think so.
He would have told us beforehand.

28:58.145 --> 28:59.905
Let me send him another text.

29:00.585 --> 29:03.225
A colleague of mine committed suicide.

29:04.785 --> 29:05.665
It just happened.

29:09.385 --> 29:10.465
He was fine.

29:10.545 --> 29:11.985
Why did he commit suicide?

29:12.065 --> 29:13.225
‎What's so hard for him to get over?

29:17.985 --> 29:19.025
This place, right?

29:19.545 --> 29:21.345
It was split open. His head was…

29:21.425 --> 29:22.705
I heard he was developing
self-driving cars.

29:22.785 --> 29:24.865
-He jumped down from upstairs.
-That floor.

29:24.945 --> 29:25.905
From upstairs.

29:25.985 --> 29:28.225
-It's so tall.
-I wonder what happened to him.

29:28.305 --> 29:29.625
I heard the fall was really bad.

29:29.705 --> 29:31.905
Captain, the victim's phone is ringing.

29:35.465 --> 29:36.345
Hello?

29:37.305 --> 29:38.225
Are you the victim's family member?

30:17.745 --> 30:20.625
Officer. Who is this?

30:20.705 --> 30:22.625
An employee of this building.
I can't disclose anything else.

30:23.345 --> 30:24.385
An employee?

30:39.145 --> 30:40.905
I really want to jump into the clouds.

30:43.825 --> 30:45.625
Actually, I'm unwell.

30:45.705 --> 30:47.105
I'm very sad.

30:47.185 --> 30:50.585
But no matter what I did,
and how much effort I put into it,

30:51.585 --> 30:54.105
I couldn't achieve the result I wanted.

30:55.465 --> 30:58.905
I've put in 99% effort into it.

30:59.945 --> 31:02.825
Why can't I get that final 1%

31:02.905 --> 31:04.705
luck?

31:29.865 --> 31:30.745
No.

31:32.265 --> 31:33.345
It's not him, right?

31:52.625 --> 31:53.825
No.

31:53.905 --> 31:55.305
It's not real, Tao.

32:18.465 --> 32:19.345
Everyone, don't gather here.

32:19.425 --> 32:20.745
Disperse. Move along.

32:20.825 --> 32:21.665
Take care of the body first.

32:21.745 --> 32:23.105
Contact the coroner
and his family members.

32:32.105 --> 32:34.665
EMERGENCY RESCUE

34:38.145 --> 34:39.065
You must be hungry.

34:55.425 --> 34:56.945
I am Sun Yuanzhu.

34:57.025 --> 34:57.865
WELCOME HOME

34:57.945 --> 34:59.585
Does your name mean

34:59.665 --> 35:00.785
"With fierce ambition
that reaches beyond the four seas,

35:00.865 --> 35:02.465
I spread my wings
and long to soar to distant horizons?"

35:03.785 --> 35:05.625
I bought many ingredients today.

35:05.705 --> 35:06.705
It's so heavy.

35:07.305 --> 35:08.745
I also bought flour.

35:08.825 --> 35:10.545
Let me make handmade noodles
for all of you later.

35:12.465 --> 35:15.305
I want to get a longer dining table

35:15.385 --> 35:18.185
so everyone can sit and work together.

35:18.265 --> 35:20.825
Then, I want to rearrange the living room.

35:20.905 --> 35:22.745
The sofa and bookshelves are new.

35:25.225 --> 35:27.385
This is Luke's home now.

36:04.825 --> 36:07.505
Tomato and egg noodles without tomatoes

36:07.585 --> 36:09.225
have no souls.

36:09.945 --> 36:11.505
Have a spoonful.

36:11.585 --> 36:13.265
Have two spoonfuls.

36:15.225 --> 36:16.425
Add this yourself.

36:17.505 --> 36:19.185
-Try it.
-You too.

36:19.265 --> 36:20.345
Try it first.

36:29.065 --> 36:30.065
Delicious.

36:31.665 --> 36:32.505
Have another spoonful.

36:42.465 --> 36:43.505
Sun Yu.

36:44.545 --> 36:45.825
Sun Yu, stop.

36:57.065 --> 36:58.705
It tastes like Yuanzhu's cooking.

38:16.705 --> 38:20.705
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

38:26.465 --> 38:28.985
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

38:31.305 --> 38:32.265
I'm going to be late.

38:32.345 --> 38:34.305
Don't need to send me off. I can go alone.

38:52.425 --> 38:53.505
Will we…

38:56.225 --> 38:58.385
have a bright future ahead of us?

39:03.185 --> 39:05.025
Will I ever get to see the future

39:05.625 --> 39:06.505
where we

39:07.305 --> 39:08.345
love each other

39:09.425 --> 39:13.425
and spend many years
walking through life together?

39:29.745 --> 39:30.585
Sorry.

39:59.745 --> 40:00.705
Sun Yu.

40:02.585 --> 40:04.985
I will watch you fall in love,

40:05.545 --> 40:07.265
get married, have kids,

40:08.665 --> 40:09.985
be happy forever,

40:10.985 --> 40:12.185
and never suffer from beyond the world.

41:01.825 --> 41:03.505
SUN YU: I WILL WATCH YOU FALL IN LOVE
GET MARRIED, HAVE KIDS

41:03.585 --> 41:05.425
BE HAPPY FOREVER
AND NEVER SUFFER FROM BEYOND THE WORLD

41:16.545 --> 41:17.705
Sun Yuanzhu,

41:19.465 --> 41:21.065
I hope I can meet you

41:22.065 --> 41:24.105
when I'm 17 years old in my next life.

41:25.225 --> 41:27.265
I want to give all my love

41:28.625 --> 41:29.505
to you.

41:30.625 --> 41:31.945
From when I'm young

41:32.865 --> 41:33.905
until I grow old,

41:35.785 --> 41:36.625
I hope

41:37.425 --> 41:39.905
all the "I love yous" I told you

41:41.985 --> 41:44.225
will become the lights on your journey

41:45.425 --> 41:47.265
that illuminate your path
to the afterlife.

41:50.105 --> 41:51.185
I hope

41:52.545 --> 41:53.625
you no longer suffer.

42:15.425 --> 42:16.265
Come in.

42:17.505 --> 42:18.385
Do you want some water?

42:29.945 --> 42:31.385
Yuanzhu's diary.

42:32.425 --> 42:34.825
Keep it. It's a keepsake.

42:35.825 --> 42:36.825
Read it first.

42:37.385 --> 42:38.345
He mentioned you.

42:52.745 --> 42:53.905
Her name is Shang Zhitao.

42:54.705 --> 42:56.105
Like the flourishing peach tree

42:56.185 --> 42:57.265
with its brilliant blossoms,

42:57.985 --> 42:59.025
the name perfectly suits her.

42:59.945 --> 43:01.505
Her bright smile

43:02.225 --> 43:03.825
can light up the whole world.

43:06.585 --> 43:07.945
Tao said

43:08.025 --> 43:10.105
she wanted to receive roses.

43:10.185 --> 43:11.145
Sun Yu,

43:12.065 --> 43:13.585
can you give me a bouquet of flowers?

43:18.985 --> 43:20.425
I gave her flowers for a few days,

43:20.505 --> 43:21.865
and I saw how happy she was.

43:22.865 --> 43:24.785
I hope she can be this happy forever.

43:29.505 --> 43:32.705
Tao wrote these words
on the postcard she sent me from Phuket.

43:33.465 --> 43:35.425
I hope smiles are the only thing

43:35.505 --> 43:36.665
you see in your eyes.

43:36.745 --> 43:38.465
TO SUN YUANZHU
MAY YOUR EYES SEE ONLY SMILES

43:43.665 --> 43:46.185
I want to tell her that I hope

43:47.305 --> 43:48.985
every dream she has

43:49.785 --> 43:51.105
won't be an empty dream.

43:55.465 --> 43:58.505
She is like a shining star.

43:59.025 --> 44:01.545
Pure, wonderful,

44:04.425 --> 44:05.785
and out of reach.

44:08.625 --> 44:10.305
I'm like the fox

44:10.945 --> 44:12.545
who watches over her.

44:13.705 --> 44:15.585
I can only look at her from afar

44:16.625 --> 44:17.665
without approaching her.

44:19.745 --> 44:21.105
I can't have her.

44:21.625 --> 44:23.865
I hope Tao will never know about this.

44:24.545 --> 44:25.385
I hope…

44:25.465 --> 44:26.905
I HOPE SHE CAN BE HAPPY FOREVER

44:26.985 --> 44:28.105
…she can do whatever she wants.

44:28.185 --> 44:32.305
I HOPE SHE CAN DO WHATEVER SHE WANTS

44:32.385 --> 44:34.225
Sometimes, staying away

44:35.585 --> 44:37.105
is also a kind of love.

44:38.385 --> 44:40.785
People were born to be free,

44:40.865 --> 44:43.225
but they are always bound by shackles.

44:43.825 --> 44:46.385
Tao doesn't seem happy
in her relationship.

44:46.465 --> 44:48.065
Perhaps

44:48.145 --> 44:50.505
every relationship is just a hierarchy

44:51.905 --> 44:53.785
until you can stand
on equal footing with one another.

44:55.265 --> 44:56.865
I blame myself.

44:57.905 --> 45:00.505
If I had worked harder
and not had so much burden,

45:02.025 --> 45:04.345
could I bring her happiness?

45:07.825 --> 45:09.465
But perhaps being happy is difficult.

45:11.345 --> 45:12.785
I haven't learned it myself.

45:14.985 --> 45:17.265
April is the most miserable month.

45:18.665 --> 45:19.865
Only faded memories remain

45:21.265 --> 45:23.025
on this barren wasteland.

45:24.185 --> 45:25.865
I'm someone who's empty inside,

45:26.825 --> 45:28.665
wandering in the void.

45:30.025 --> 45:31.305
My heart

45:32.465 --> 45:34.105
has also turned into an empty wasteland.

45:35.545 --> 45:36.465
Mom…

45:40.825 --> 45:41.705
passed away.

45:44.785 --> 45:47.225
I yearn for the rain.
I yearn to be nourished.

45:47.305 --> 45:48.225
I yearn…

45:51.465 --> 45:52.505
to be reborn.

45:54.905 --> 45:55.985
But…

45:58.505 --> 45:59.905
is there still hope?

46:05.105 --> 46:09.905
THAT LIGHT, IT SEEMS UNREACHABLE

46:10.745 --> 46:11.625
Farewell,

46:13.025 --> 46:14.465
the world I loved

46:16.585 --> 46:17.705
and the people I loved.

46:18.905 --> 46:19.985
Let's not see each other again.

46:37.905 --> 46:39.145
So you've always known.

46:44.825 --> 46:45.665
Sun Yu.

46:55.465 --> 46:56.505
I'm so sorry.

46:58.305 --> 46:59.505
Don't be.

47:00.985 --> 47:02.185
I was just

47:03.745 --> 47:04.585
loving him

47:06.025 --> 47:07.185
purely.

47:08.425 --> 47:09.785
It doesn't matter who he liked.

47:17.425 --> 47:19.305
Throughout my long years,

47:21.425 --> 47:24.505
he has given me countless moments
of warmth and kindness.

47:30.985 --> 47:33.185
I, Sun Yu, fell in love with an angel.

47:40.265 --> 47:41.105
He

47:42.665 --> 47:44.305
was an angel.

47:57.625 --> 47:59.425
Why are you crying?

48:39.465 --> 48:41.225
I still remember the time

48:41.305 --> 48:42.745
I first met you.

48:43.985 --> 48:45.345
It has been six years now.

48:45.425 --> 48:46.785
Time passes so quickly.
